WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.725
A program runs from the top down, and a loop repeats lines for you.

2
00:00:05.575 --> 00:00:09.825
A for loop does the lines indented under it, here four times.

3
00:00:10.725 --> 00:00:16.050
forward 100 draws a line, and right 90 turns a quarter of a full turn.

4
00:00:19.587 --> 00:00:25.137
Four turns of 90 degrees add up to one full turn, 360 degrees.
